          "cachedResultName": "models/gemma-3-4b-it"
        },
        "text": "You are an expert OCR and data extraction assistant for academic question papers. \nCarefully analyze the provided document and extract all text, tables, and structural elements into a rigidly formatted JSON object.\nUse the exact keys provided in the structure below. Do NOT output any markdown tags (like ```json), give only the raw string.\n\nIf the paper is divided into PART-A and PART-B, utilize the \"part_a\" and \"part_b\" structures. \nIf it is a single table of questions (like an Internal Assessment), utilize the \"questions_table\" structure instead.\n\nStrictly adhere to this JSON structure format:\n{\n  \"institution_header\": [\"string array of top header lines\"],\n  \"exam_details\": {\n    \"examination_name\": \"string\",\n    \"duration\": \"string\",\n    \"course_code\": \"string\",\n    \"maximum_marks\": \"string\",\n    \"subject\": \"string\"\n  },\n  \"instructions\": [\"string array of notes/instructions\"],\n  \"part_a\": {\n    \"heading\": \"string\",\n    \"table_headers\": [\"string array\"],\n    \"questions\": [\n      {\n        \"Q.No.\": \"string\",\n        \"Question\": \"string\",\n        \"BL\": \"string\",\n        \"CO\": \"string\",\n        \"PO\": \"string\",\n        \"Marks\": \"string\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"part_b\": {\n    \"heading\": \"string\",\n    \"table_headers\": [\"string array\"],\n    \"modules\": [\n      {\n        \"heading\": \"string value (e.g., Module-1)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"Q.No.\": \"optional string\",\n            \"sub_question\": \"optional string (e.g., a, b)\",\n            \"Question\": \"optional string\",\n            \"BL\": \"optional string\",\n            \"CO\": \"optional string\",\n            \"PO\": \"optional string\",\n            \"Marks\": \"optional string\",\n            \"separator\": \"optional string (use only if there's an 'OR' separator)\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"questions_table\": {\n    \"table_headers\": [\"string array\"],\n    \"questions\": [\n       { \"Q.No.\": \"string\", \"Question\": \"string\", \"BL\": \"string\", \"CO\": \"string\", \"PO\": \"string\", \"Marks\": \"string\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"footer_markers\": [\"string array of footer texts like page numbers or codes\"]\n}\n",
        "inputType": "binary",
        "binaryPropertyName": "files",
        "options": {}
      },
